cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the accompanying manuscript when using this reproducibility package."
type: software
title: "Implicit Deep Learning Models for Robust Nonlinear Inverse Control: Reproducibility Package"
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Calafiore
    given-names: Giuseppe C.
  - family-names: El Ghaoui
    given-names: Laurent
abstract: >-
  Code and trained checkpoints for algebraic inversion of implicit neural
  input-output models, with measured-history closed-loop robustness
  certificates and finite-solver-residual bounds. Includes static MIMO,
  nonlinear NARX, and physics-guided servo experiments.
keywords:
  - implicit deep learning
  - model inversion
  - nonlinear control
  - NARX
  - robustness certificates
